      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROADS END (1) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Healesville over 350m behind Major Illusion (19.86) in a Grade 5. The form out of his last race has been franked. Can atone. CRACKERJACK TREV (4) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (30.83) in a Grade 5 at The Meadows. Form at the trip sound including eight wins. Has ability and is one of the better chances. HAY RILEY (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Traralgon behind SWEET TRILBY (20.33) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Will give a great sight again. TWENTY BLACK (8) is worth a look despite no experience at this circuit.",
